OL,3,GNEWSA'Motherlode' of Brighton shirts
OL,4,A'tell club's story'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I believe a shirt tells a story," says
OL,7,FGraeme Stokes, surrounded by thousands
OL,8,Fof vintage strips and boxes of football
OL,9,Fmemorabilia.
OL,11,FHis shop in Brighton has recently
OL,12,Fbought "the motherlode" of Brighton &
OL,13,FHove Albion shirts, a total of 120 that
OL,14,Fdate back to the early 1990s.
OL,16,FHis favourite and the one he believes
OL,17,Fto be the rarest is dark blue, with the
OL,18,Fsponsor Palookaville emblazoned across
OL,19,Fit.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
