OL,3,GNEWSA'Motherlode' of Brighton shirts
OL,4,A'tell club's story'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "Fatboy Slim, the DJ, he
OL,7,Fhelped the club out when they were in
OL,8,Fsome financial difficulty by sponsoring
OL,9,Fthe shirts...and Palookaville was an
OL,10,Falbum that he released."
